{{#> layout}}
<section class="collection-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR SET BINDER · COLLECTION {{collection_id}}</p><h1>Every set tells a story.</h1><p class="lede">Find the gaps. Watch your collection grow.</p></div><a class="quiet-link external-link" href="{{collection_url}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View on {{provider_name}} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
<div data-share-tools><div class="copy-actions"><button type="button" class="button" data-copy-view>Copy link to this view</button><span class="copy-status" data-copy-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></span></div><label class="copy-fallback" data-copy-fallback hidden>Copy this link<textarea readonly rows="2" spellcheck="false"></textarea></label></div>
<dl class="collection-stats"><div><dt>Sets in collection</dt><dd>{{set_count}}</dd></div><div><dt>Base sets complete</dt><dd>{{completed_count}}<span class="stat-detail">all base printings matched</span></dd></div><div><dt>Printings matched</dt><dd>{{matched_count}}<span class="stat-detail">across known sets</span></dd></div></dl>
<div class="section-heading"><h2>Your sets <span class="count-label">{{set_count}}</span></h2><p id="set-results" role="status" aria-live="polite">{{set_count}} sets</p></div>
<div class="progress-legend" aria-label="Progress bar colours"><span>Base printings · 0–100%:</span><span><i class="legend-dot rarity-colour common" aria-hidden="true"></i>Common</span><span><i class="legend-dot rarity-colour uncommon" aria-hidden="true"></i>Uncommon</span><span><i class="legend-dot rarity-colour rare" aria-hidden="true"></i>Rare</span><span><i class="legend-dot rarity-colour mythic" aria-hidden="true"></i>Mythic</span><span><i class="legend-dot rarity-colour special" aria-hidden="true"></i>Special / bonus</span><span><i class="legend-dot rarity-colour unknown" aria-hidden="true"></i>Unknown</span><span><i class="legend-dot variant-dot" aria-hidden="true"></i>Variants · bonus beyond 100%</span><span><i class="legend-dot rarity-colour rarity-missing" aria-hidden="true"></i>Muted stripes · missing</span></div>
<details class="progress-explanation"><summary>How is progress calculated?</summary><p>For each Oracle ID in a set, the printing with the lowest collector number is the base; all other printings are variants. Collector numbers use natural order (2 before 10, then 10a). This is our collecting rule for every set, including promos and basic lands.</p><p>Collected base printings stack together by rarity. Each colour shows owned base printings of that rarity ÷ the base-set size; the remainder stacks missing printings by rarity in muted, striped versions of the same colours. Solid colours show collected printings; muted stripes show missing printings. Hover over a section for its counts. The separate variant bonus adds variants owned ÷ base-set size, so owning a variant never fills a missing base printing. Each bar fits the base target plus the earned bonus; the marker shows 100% base. Cards without an Oracle ID remain unclassified and are excluded from both percentages.</p><p>Each collector number counts once, regardless of quantity or foil finish. Only sets in your collection are shown.</p></details>
<section class="browse-toolbar" aria-label="Find sets" data-set-controls hidden>
  <label class="search-field" for="set-search"><span class="sr-only">Search sets</span><input type="search" id="set-search" placeholder="Search by release, set name or code…" maxlength="200" aria-controls="set-list" /></label>
  <div class="segmented" role="group" aria-label="Base completion filter"><button type="button" data-set-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All</button><button type="button" data-set-filter="incomplete" aria-pressed="false">Incomplete</button><button type="button" data-set-filter="complete" aria-pressed="false">Complete</button><button type="button" data-set-filter="unavailable" aria-pressed="false">Unavailable</button></div>
  <label class="sort-control" for="set-sort"><span>Sort by</span><select id="set-sort"><option value="completion">Base completion</option><option value="missing">Fewest base missing</option><option value="name">Set name</option></select></label>
</section>
<div class="set-list" id="set-list">
{{#each release_groups}}
<section class="release-group" data-release-code="{{code}}" data-release-name="{{name}}">
{{#if show_heading}}<header class="release-heading"><h2>{{name}}</h2><span class="count-label" data-release-count>{{set_count}} {{#if single_set}}set{{else}}sets{{/if}}</span></header>{{/if}}
{{#each sets}}
<article class="set-row" data-set-code="{{code}}" data-set-name="{{#if name}}{{name}}{{else}}{{code}}{{/if}}" data-available="{{base_available}}" data-complete="{{complete}}" data-completion="{{base_completion}}" data-missing="{{missing_count}}">
  <div class="set-identity"><span class="set-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><i class="ss ss-{{code}}"></i></span><div><span class="set-code">{{code}}</span><h3>{{#if name}}{{name}}{{else}}Unknown set{{/if}}</h3></div></div>
  <div class="set-progress">{{> progress}}</div>
  <button class="button view-set" data-open="{{code}}" data-details-url="/{{../../provider_slug}}/{{../../collection_id}}/sets/{{code}}" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="View {{#if name}}{{name}}{{else}}{{code}}{{/if}}">View set <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
</article>
{{/each}}
</section>
{{else}}<div class="empty-state"><h3>A fresh binder.</h3><p>No cards were found in this collection. Add some cards on Archidekt, then return here.</p><a class="button" href="/">Try another collection</a></div>{{/each}}
</div>
<div class="empty-state" id="set-empty" hidden><h3>No sets match this view.</h3><p>Try another search or completion filter.</p><button class="button" id="reset-sets">Reset set filters</button></div>
<dialog id="set-dialog" aria-labelledby="dialog-title"></dialog>
<noscript><p class="field-error">Enable JavaScript to open set details and change appearance.</p></noscript>
{{/layout}}
